{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01406","headline":"相和歌辞 乌夜啼二首 一 · 顾况","name":"相和歌辞 乌夜啼二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉房掣锁声翻叶，银箭添泉遶霜堞。\n毕逋发刺月衔城，八九雏飞其母惊。\n此是天上老鵶鸣，人间老鵶无此声。\n摇杂佩，耿华烛，良夜羽人弹此曲，东方曈曈赤日旭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}